{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If robot sees object, approach it and take it. Then check object size. If object X, place it in zone 1,2 or 3. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectSize    /> <Action ID = MoveToZoneOne    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInZoneOne    /> <Action ID = MoveToZoneTwo    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInZoneTwo    /> <Action ID = MoveToZoneThree    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInZoneThree    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    />",
    "BT": {
